# Coding Standards

## Style (Standard.js)
- 2 space indentation
- Single quotes (except to avoid escaping)
- No semicolons
- No unused variables
- Space after keywords, before function parens

## React Patterns
```jsx
// Component definition
export function MyComponent({ prop1, prop2 }) {
  const [state, setState] = useState(null)
  
  // Early returns for loading/error states
  if (!data) return <Loading />
  
  return <div>...</div>
}
```

## Naming
- Components: PascalCase (`PhotoGuidelinesDialog`)
- Functions/variables: camelCase (`handleSubmit`)
- Directories: kebab-case (`generator-card/`)
- Files: kebab-case for components (`photo-guidelines-dialog.tsx`)

## Imports Order
1. React/Next.js
2. Third-party libraries
3. Local components (@/components/)
4. Local utilities (@/lib/)
5. Types (@/types/)
